{
  "id": "Lyo.Billing.Client",
  "name": "Lyo.Billing.Client",
  "area": "Apps",
  "tagline": "Typed HTTP client targeting the Lyo Billing API (`netstandard2.0;net10.0`).",
  "description": "Typed HTTP client targeting the Lyo Billing API (`netstandard2.0;net10.0`).\n\nBlazor hosts and workers should call draft/issue/void/pay through this client against an API host that runs [`Lyo.Billing.Api`](../Lyo.Billing.Api/README.md). Do **not** inject `IConfiguration` to build invoice PDF hrefs — use `IBillingClient.InvoicePdfHref`.\n\n```csharp\nservices.AddBillingClient<ApiClient>();\nservices.AddBillingClient<ApiClient>(o => o.RoutePrefix = \"api\");\nservices.AddBillingClientFromConfiguration<ApiClient>(configuration); // section BillingClientOptions\n// or resolve the API client through a factory:\nservices.AddBillingClient(sp => sp.GetRequiredService<IApiClient>());\n```\n\n```csharp\nvar draft = await billing.CreateDraftAsync(new CreateDraftInvoiceRequest { ClientId = clientId });\nawait billing.AddLineAsync(draft.Id, new InvoiceLineRecord { Description = \"Design\", Quantity = 2m, UnitAmount = 100m });\nvar issued = await billing.IssueAsync(draft.Id);\nawait billing.PayAsync(issued.Id, new RecordInvoicePaymentRequest { Amount = issued.Total, Method = PaymentMethod.Wire });\nvar pdfHref = billing.InvoicePdfHref(issued.Id);\n```\n\nAuth rides on the underlying `IApiClient` / `HttpClient` (the same bearer as other API calls). Invoice PDFs are generated by the Reporting host at `GET /Reporting/Invoices/{id}/pdf`.",
  "features": [
    "Typed methods for from-charges, draft, lines, issue, void, pay, summary, and unbilled charges.",
    "`InvoicePdfHref` builds `{BaseAddress}/Reporting/Invoices/{id}/pdf` so UI does not read `ApiClient:BaseUrl` from configuration."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Register the client",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddLyoApiClient();\nservices.AddBillingClient<ApiClient>();"
    }
  ],
